SUMMARY:Murder Mystery Train Experience at Strasburg Rail Road
DESCRIPTION:Murder Mystery: The Retirement of Miles Bishop\nDearest Friends and Family\, you are cordially invited to the retirement celebration of the legendary 1930s jazz pianist\, Miles Bishop. As he prepares to retire his ivories for a simpler life\, he is set to go out in style aboard the historic Strasburg Rail Road—the oldest continuously operating railroad in America\, chartered in 1832. What begins as a night of music\, laughter\, and high-society flair soon takes a dark turn\, proving that even on a legacy rail line\, the tracks ahead are never certain. Join the sharp-witted Detective Sterling Hawthorn as she navigates the high-stakes world of fame and fortune\, uncovering a web of secrets woven by a high-powered agent\, a jealous friend\, and a famous singer. As the rhythmic steam of our heritage locomotive carries you through the night\, you must help the Detective solve the mystery before the final curtain falls. Experience this thrilling\, 45-minute murderous adventure where the craftsmanship of our early 20th-century cars meets a timeless tale of suspense.\n\nATTENTION: Please note that all Dinner on the Rail passengers must be age 21 or older with a proper photo ID to board the train. Each guest will be carded\, pursuant to state law. In addition\, in accordance with Pennsylvania law\, alcohol can only be served during the train ride. Alcoholic drinks must be consumed before exiting the train; alcohol is not permitted off the train. Strasburg Rail Road is not permitted to serve alcoholic drinks while the train is berthed in the Station.
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/murder-mystery-strasburg-rail-road-2/
LOCATION:Strasburg Rail Road\, 301 Gap Road\, Ronks\, PA\, 17572\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults Only,Food & Beverage Events,Murder Mystery,Railroad,Strasburg, PA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/strasburg-rail-road-event-motif-for-murder.webp
GEO:39.9830724;-76.1597641
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Strasburg Rail Road 301 Gap Road Ronks PA 17572 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=301 Gap Road:geo:-76.1597641,39.9830724
END:VEVENT
