SUMMARY:The Ephrata Fair
DESCRIPTION:The Ephrata Fair\, known as the largest street fair in Pennsylvania\, has been a cornerstone of local history for over a century. Spanning several blocks in downtown Ephrata\, this late-September tradition masterfully balances modern thrills with agricultural roots. \nThe Ephrata Farmers Day Association manages the event\, placing a heavy emphasis on Pennsylvania’s top industry through livestock competitions and agricultural exhibits. While the Midway buzzes with rides\, games\, and iconic street food\, the heart of the fair remains its commitment to community heritage. From the famous Wednesday night parade to the unique farm displays\, it offers a memorable\, high-energy experience for residents and visitors alike. \n\n\n\nSee our schedule of Fairs & Festivals in Lancaster County and surrounding areas.\nOther Things To Do in Lancaster\, PA\n\n\nArt Galleries\nDistilleries\nEscape Rooms\nFactory Tours\n\n\n\nIndoor Things To Do\nMassage and Spas\nOutdoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nShooting Ranges\nTheaters\nWineries\nAll Things To Do in Lancaster
