DESCRIPTION:Raise a Stein\, tie on your dirndl\, and buckle your lederhosen as the Shire of Mount Hope celebrates Oktoberfest! \nSwashbuckler Beers are the star of this weekend\, as well as traditional Oktoberfest games\, dancing\, and music for all to enjoy. \n\nSee our schedule of Fairs & Festivals in Lancaster County and surrounding areas.\nOther Things To Do in Lancaster\, PA\n\n\nArt Galleries\nDistilleries\nEscape Rooms\nFactory Tours\n\n\n\nIndoor Things To Do\nMassage and Spas\nOutdoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nShooting Ranges\nTheaters\nWineries\nAll Things To Do in Lancaster
