SUMMARY:Art in the Park - Columbia\, PA
DESCRIPTION:An annual outdoor event hosted by Create Columbia that showcases the work of local and regional fine artists. \nColumbia’s Locust Street park will feature displays of quality art to admire or purchase. \nEntry to the park is free. \nFollow Create Columbia on Facebook for current and updated information. Artists interested in participating can find an application on our website in the ‘Art in the Park’ event listing.
