SUMMARY:Cider Donut Festival - Cherry-Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Who loves Cherry Crest’s cider donuts????❤️\n\n\nIf you do\, don’t miss this mouthwatering extravaganza! \nWhether you’re a kid or just young at heart\, the Cider Donut Fall Festival promises a day packed with laughter\, adventure\, and\, most importantly\, mouthwatering delights. Embrace the crisp autumn air as you enjoy a variety of treats\, from our classic cider donuts to innovative donut creations that will tempt your taste buds. Celebrate the flavors of fall with family and friends\, take in the beauty of the season\, and join us for an unforgettable autumn tradition-because here at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm\, the fun never stops! \nFestival Highlights:\n\nDelicious Cider Donut Specialty Treats\nCider Donut Eating Contest\nDonut Games and Activities\nSpecial Donut Photo Ops\nLocal Brewery & Winery\nLive Music\n\n\n\n– Plus –\n\n\nYou will have the unique opportunity to feed donuts to someone that loves them more then you… our cows! That’s right\, our cows just LOVE cider donuts. Take a wagon ride into the pasture and hand feed the cows donuts*- they will love you for it! \n*Extra fee for special wagon ride \n\n\n\nFarm: 10am – 10pm\nFestival Activities: 12pm – 8pm\nFireworks: 8:30pm\n\n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/cider-donut-festival-cherry-crest-adventure-farm/
LOCATION:Cherry Crest Adventure Farm\, 150 Cherry Hill Road\, Ronks\, PA\, 17572\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children & Family Events,Corn Maze,Fairs & Festivals,Food & Beverage Events,Strasburg, PA
